  "content": "\n\n<h1 id=\"hello-and-welcome\">歡迎來到 Bloxy 的結構！</h1>\n<h4>這個模組新增了一個名為「冒險領域」的全新維度。<br>在這個維度中，你將會面對全新的結構、首領與敵人。<br>若你能成功克服挑戰，就能獲得全新的物品與工具，助你旅途一臂之力！</h4>\n<p>查看圖片以了解部分結構與維度的樣貌 - <em>（模組版本 1.15 及以上）</em><br>如果你好奇的話，這些光影的名稱是「Complementary Unbound」</p>\n\n## \n<details>\n<summary>影片</summary>\n\n<p><span class=\"mce-preview-object mce-object-iframe\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-mce-object=\"iframe\" data-mce-p-allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-p-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F71A4cp9Rrg\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F71A4cp9Rrg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F71A4cp9Rrg\"></iframe><span class=\"mce-shim\"></span></span><br><span contenteditable=\"false\" data-mce-object=\"iframe\" class=\"mce-preview-object mce-object-iframe\" data-mce-p-allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-p-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YxbXoxsU3Yc\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YxbXoxsU3Yc\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe><span class=\"mce-shim\"></span></span><br><span contenteditable=\"false\" data-mce-object=\"iframe\" class=\"mce-preview-object mce-object-iframe\" data-mce-p-allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-p-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/syjBaUHcD0w\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/syjBaUHcD0w\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe><span class=\"mce-shim\"></span></span><br><span contenteditable=\"false\" data-mce-object=\"iframe\" class=\"mce-preview-object mce-object-iframe\" data-mce-p-allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-p-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7OcNTVK_oIg\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/7OcNTVK_oIg\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe><span class=\"mce-shim\"></span></span><span contenteditable=\"false\" data-mce-object=\"iframe\" class=\"mce-preview-object mce-object-iframe\" data-mce-p-allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" data-mce-p-src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WlVxQsOoFTc\"><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"314\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/WlVxQsOoFTc\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" frameborder=\"0\"></iframe><span class=\"mce-shim\"></span></span></p>\n\n</details>\n\n## \n\n<p><strong>- 其他資訊 -<br></strong>此模組可放入任何整合包中，無論個人或商業用途皆可。<br>本模組使用 MCreator 與 Blockbench 製作。</p>",
